Yeah.
是啊。

1626
01:10:30.500 --> 01:10:32.200
It's a classic.
这是个经典。

1627
01:10:32.200 --> 01:10:37.060
So Michael and Dwight, yes, they're doing sort of this performance, you know?
所以迈克尔和德怀特，没错，他们是在进行某种表演，你懂的？

1628
01:10:37.400 --> 01:10:38.040
They've got it.
他们掌握了精髓。

1629
01:10:38.260 --> 01:10:40.200
Clearly, they have rehearsed this.
很明显，他们排练过。

1630
01:10:40.620 --> 01:10:44.740
