Kevin says, if someone gives you 10,000 to one odds on anything, you take it.
凯文说，如果有人给你一万比一的赔率赌任何事，你一定要接。

1637
01:10:59.200 --> 01:11:03.880
And if John Mellencamp ever wins an Oscar, Kevin's going to be a very rich dude.
如果约翰·梅伦坎普哪天真赢了奥斯卡，凯文就要发大财了。

1638
