You go, Kev.
干得好，凯文。

1639
01:11:05.680 --> 01:11:06.500
You go, Kev.
干得好，凯文。

1640
01:11:07.200 --> 01:11:13.940
Well, my favorite part of this, Angela, is when Michael realizes that the warehouse guys aren't there.
安吉拉，这一段我最喜欢的部分是迈克尔意识到仓库的人不在的时候。

1641
01:11:14.080 --> 01:11:16.480
Those are the ones he wants to impress the moSt.
那些才是他最想打动的人。

1642
01:11:16.520 --> 01:11:20.380
Yeah, he doesn't care about doing this for his co-workers upstairs.
没错，他根本不在乎给楼上的同事表演。

1643
01:11:20.380 --> 01:11:27.520
The whole point of this, and he gets so frustrated with Dwight, is that the warehouse guys see that he's on the roof.
整件事的重点——他为此对德怀特感到非常沮丧——就是他想让仓库的人看到他在屋顶上。

1644
01:11:28.120 --> 01:11:28.720
Yes.
