He says, Dwight, you ignorant slut, again.
他又说了一遍：“德怀特，你这个无知的荡妇。”

1648
01:11:44.100 --> 01:11:44.260
Yeah.
是啊。

1649
01:11:44.440 --> 01:11:47.080
Dwight does his air quotes with his fingers again.
